    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome to <strong>Cafe Haven</strong>, a cozy cafe management game. Whether you dream of crafting the perfect menu, managing a talented team, or designing a cafe that\u2019s uniquely yours, <strong>Cafe Haven</strong> lets you do it all.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Unlock &amp; Perfect Recipes</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Delight your customers with culinary perfection!</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock a variety of  recipes as your cafe grows.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use customer reviews to refine your dishes, adjusting ingredient quantities for the perfect flavor.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Perfecting recipes doesn\u2019t just make your customers happy\u2014it boosts your cafe\u2019s popularity and helps your business thrive!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3376510/extras/0b37c7591ed86c626f562147b1587e04.poster.avif?t=1740693621\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3376510/extras/0b37c7591ed86c626f562147b1587e04.webm?t=1740693621\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3376510/extras/0b37c7591ed86c626f562147b1587e04.mp4?t=1740693621\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Staff Management</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your team is the backbone of your cafe.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hire skilled employees to ensure smooth and efficient service.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Keep an eye on staff happiness and fatigue\u2014overworked employees might call in sick or even quit!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As your cafe rating improves, expand your team and create effective work schedules to handle the growing demand.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3376510/extras/4cfa358a94a44235e236d071f88247b3.poster.avif?t=1740693621\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3376510/extras/4cfa358a94a44235e236d071f88247b3.webm?t=1740693621\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3376510/extras/4cfa358a94a44235e236d071f88247b3.mp4?t=1740693621\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Decorate Your Cafe</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Transform your cafe into a cozy haven that reflects your unique style!</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock a variety of decorations as your cafe earns higher ratings.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Customize the look and feel of your cafe to attract customers and create a welcoming atmosphere.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Design a space that\u2019s as beautiful as it is functional.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3376510/extras/37d5ba0f1b2811b72a822dcd9b6c2d14.poster.avif?t=1740693621\" width=800 height=449 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3376510/extras/37d5ba0f1b2811b72a822dcd9b6c2d14.webm?t=1740693621\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Maintain Your Cafe</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Stay on your toes to keep things running smoothly!</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tackle random events like trash buildup, floor spills, and even equipment fires in real time.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Keep your customers happy and your employees productive by resolving these challenges quickly.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every action counts in maintaining a clean, safe, and efficient environment.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3376510/extras/7b753bbb3968aa0a0d9d876bac8cd749.poster.avif?t=1740693621\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3376510/extras/7b753bbb3968aa0a0d9d876bac8cd749.webm?t=1740693621\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3376510/extras/7b753bbb3968aa0a0d9d876bac8cd749.mp4?t=1740693621\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong> <br>Cafe Haven</strong> is a perfect blend of strategy, creativity, and cozy charm. Whether you\u2019re perfecting recipes, managing your team, or building the cafe of your dreams, every decision shapes the story of your cafe. Will you rise to become the most beloved cafe in town?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your <strong>Cafe Haven</strong> journey begins now!</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome to <strong>Cafe Haven</strong>, a cozy cafe management game. Whether you dream of crafting the perfect menu, managing a talented team, or designing a cafe that\u2019s uniquely yours, <strong>Cafe Haven</strong> lets you do it all.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Unlock &amp; Perfect Recipes</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Delight your customers with culinary perfection!</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock a variety of  recipes as your cafe grows.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use customer reviews to refine your dishes, adjusting ingredient quantities for the perfect flavor.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Perfecting recipes doesn\u2019t just make your customers happy\u2014it boosts your cafe\u2019s popularity and helps your business thrive!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3376510/extras/0b37c7591ed86c626f562147b1587e04.poster.avif?t=1740693621\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3376510/extras/0b37c7591ed86c626f562147b1587e04.webm?t=1740693621\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3376510/extras/0b37c7591ed86c626f562147b1587e04.mp4?t=1740693621\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Staff Management</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your team is the backbone of your cafe.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hire skilled employees to ensure smooth and efficient service.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Keep an eye on staff happiness and fatigue\u2014overworked employees might call in sick or even quit!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As your cafe rating improves, expand your team and create effective work schedules to handle the growing demand.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3376510/extras/4cfa358a94a44235e236d071f88247b3.poster.avif?t=1740693621\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3376510/extras/4cfa358a94a44235e236d071f88247b3.webm?t=1740693621\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3376510/extras/4cfa358a94a44235e236d071f88247b3.mp4?t=1740693621\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Decorate Your Cafe</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Transform your cafe into a cozy haven that reflects your unique style!</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock a variety of decorations as your cafe earns higher ratings.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Customize the look and feel of your cafe to attract customers and create a welcoming atmosphere.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Design a space that\u2019s as beautiful as it is functional.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3376510/extras/37d5ba0f1b2811b72a822dcd9b6c2d14.poster.avif?t=1740693621\" width=800 height=449 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3376510/extras/37d5ba0f1b2811b72a822dcd9b6c2d14.webm?t=1740693621\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Maintain Your Cafe</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Stay on your toes to keep things running smoothly!</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tackle random events like trash buildup, floor spills, and even equipment fires in real time.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Keep your customers happy and your employees productive by resolving these challenges quickly.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every action counts in maintaining a clean, safe, and efficient environment.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3376510/extras/7b753bbb3968aa0a0d9d876bac8cd749.poster.avif?t=1740693621\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3376510/extras/7b753bbb3968aa0a0d9d876bac8cd749.webm?t=1740693621\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3376510/extras/7b753bbb3968aa0a0d9d876bac8cd749.mp4?t=1740693621\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong> <br>Cafe Haven</strong> is a perfect blend of strategy, creativity, and cozy charm. Whether you\u2019re perfecting recipes, managing your team, or building the cafe of your dreams, every decision shapes the story of your cafe. Will you rise to become the most beloved cafe in town?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your <strong>Cafe Haven</strong> journey begins now!</p>",
